{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.1777282527277","title":"AI support agent sering diposisikan sebagai garis pertahanan pertama, bukan pengganti manusia","desc":"AI masuk sebagai lapisan filter/triage awal yang meningkatkan manusia, bukan sebagai pengganti total.","updated":1777349975837,"created":1777282539453,"tags":["zettel","ai","support","human-in-the-loop","the-developers-guide-to-ai","part-i"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.1777282527277","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"e8b20a696c7873ab491dcc6d73139db4","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777282527277","id":"zettel.1777282527277","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777282527277","id":"zettel.1777282527277","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.ai","alias":"ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777282527277","id":"zettel.1777282527277","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.support","alias":"support","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.support"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777282527277","id":"zettel.1777282527277","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.human-in-the-loop","alias":"human-in-the-loop","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.human-in-the-loop"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777282527277","id":"zettel.1777282527277","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.the-developers-guide-to-ai","alias":"the-developers-guide-to-ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777282527277","id":"zettel.1777282527277","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.part-i","alias":"part-i","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.part-i"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777282527277","id":"zettel.1777282527277","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":3,"offset":1083},"end":{"line":24,"column":51,"offset":1131},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777282527277","id":"zettel.1777282527277","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":3,"offset":1134},"end":{"line":25,"column":48,"offset":1179},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}}],"anchors":{"ide-inti":{"type":"header","text":"Ide inti","value":"ide-inti","line":19,"column":0,"depth":2},"quote-baseline":{"type":"header","text":"Quote baseline","value":"quote-baseline","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2},"kenapa-ini-core":{"type":"header","text":"Kenapa ini core","value":"kenapa-ini-core","line":27,"column":0,"depth":2},"implikasi":{"type":"header","text":"Implikasi","value":"implikasi","line":31,"column":0,"depth":2},"sumber":{"type":"header","text":"Sumber","value":"sumber","line":38,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"ai-support-agent-sering-diposisikan-sebagai-garis-pertahanan-pertama-bukan-pengganti-manusia\">AI support agent sering diposisikan sebagai garis pertahanan pertama, bukan pengganti manusia<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#ai-support-agent-sering-diposisikan-sebagai-garis-pertahanan-pertama-bukan-pengganti-manusia\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"ide-inti\">Ide inti<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#ide-inti\"></a></h2>\n<p>Yang gue tangkap dari quote “They were the first automated line of defense” adalah bahwa AI support agent di cerita ini tidak dimaksudkan sebagai pengganti total manusia. AI diposisikan sebagai lapisan awal: filter, triage, dan force multiplier yang membantu tim, bukan menggantikan tim.</p>\n<h2 id=\"quote-baseline\">Quote baseline<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#quote-baseline\"></a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>They were the first automated line of defense.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"kenapa-ini-core\">Kenapa ini core<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#kenapa-ini-core\"></a></h2>\n<p>Quote ini penting karena dia menunjukkan arsitektur human-in-the-loop sejak awal. Itu menjadikan AI sebagai bagian dari sistem yang melibatkan manusia: AI menangani volume awal, manusia menangani eskalasi dan kasus kompleks.</p>\n<h2 id=\"implikasi\">Implikasi<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#implikasi\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>AI support agent dilihat sebagai lapisan pertahanan pertama, bukan solusi akhir.</li>\n<li>Ini mendukung pola support bot / classifier / agent workflow dengan human escalation.</li>\n<li>Jadi AI early-use case di buku bukan automation yang menghilangkan orang, tapi automation yang mengalihkan orang ke tugas yang lebih bernilai.</li>\n<li>Ini juga cocok dengan framing “first automated line of defense”: bukan pengganti, tapi pelindung dan penguat.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sumber\">Sumber<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#sumber\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Part I</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI sebagai literature note</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">support (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">human-in-the-loop (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">the-developers-guide-to-ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">part-i (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"selection2link","taskCompleteStatus":["done","x"]},"graph":{"zoomSpeed":1,"createStub":false},"enableAutoCreateOnDefinition":false,"enableXVaultWikiLink":false,"enableRemoteVaultInit":true,"enableUserTags":true,"enableHashTags":true,"workspaceVaultSyncMode":"noCommit","enableAutoFoldFrontmatter":false,"enableEditorDecorations":true,"maxPreviewsCached":10,"maxNoteLength":204800,"seeds":{"dendron.templates":{}},"enableFullHierarchyNoteTitle":false},"preview":{"enableFMTitle":true,"en